{"ID":"20230927161537-cnlma1k","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927161537-cnlma1k","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161537-cnlma1k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161537-l3a62n3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161537-l3a62n3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161537-l3a62n3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:140,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:140\u0026#125;","title":"【银翘散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927161545"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927161537-l3a62n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161537-l3a62n3","updated":"20230927161545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"银翘散：连翘一两，银花一两，苦桔梗六钱，薄荷六钱，竹叶四钱，生甘草五钱，芥穗四钱，淡豆豉五钱，牛蒡子六钱。上为散。每服六钱，鲜苇根汤煎，香气大出，即取服，勿过煮。肺药取轻清，过煎则味厚而入中焦矣。病重者，约二时一服，日三服，夜一服；轻者三时一服，日二服，夜一服；病不解者，作再服。"}]}]}